---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+13025550147';
const phoneDisplay = '(302) 555-0147';
---
<Layout title="Emergency AC Repair in Middletown, DE | AC Repair Middletown" description="Emergency AC repair in Middletown, DE. Same-day 24/7 service for no cooling, leaks, and system failures.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Emergency AC Repair</h1>
      <p>Urgent Response · Middletown &amp; New Castle County</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-block">
      <p>When your AC fails during a Middletown heat wave, every hour counts. Our emergency technicians respond around the clock with stocked vans and the parts most systems need.</p>
      <h2>What We Provide</h2>
      <ul>
          <li>24/7 emergency dispatch</li>
          <li>Average response under 60 minutes</li>
          <li>No after-hours surcharge surprises</li>
          <li>Capacitors, contactors, freon, motors on the truck</li>
          <li>Written estimate before work begins</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Ready for Service?</h2>
      <p>Call or text <a href={`tel:${phone}`} style="color:var(--primary);font-weight:600">{phoneDisplay}</a> for same-day service in Middletown, DE. Upfront pricing and a written estimate before any work begins.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:1.5rem">
        <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call {phoneDisplay}</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
